OL,3,GNEWSATeen's death inspires mum's drive
OL,4,Afor earlier rare cancer diagnosis
OL,5,
OL,6,FLiberty York was 19 when she died from
OL,7,Fa rare form of cancer, two days after
OL,8,Fher birthday.
OL,10,FA year after her death, her mother
OL,11,FHannah York has talked about her
OL,12,Fstrength and the parts of her daughter
OL,13,Fthat existed outside of her illness.
OL,15,F"The first thing that comes to mind
OL,16,Fwhen I think about Liberty is how kind
OL,17,Fshe was and thoughtful," she said.
