OL,3,GNEWSATeen's death inspires mum's drive
OL,4,Afor earlier rare cancer diagnosis
OL,5,
OL,6,FTo Hannah, she was still the same
OL,7,Fdetermined teenager throughout the
OL,8,Ffinal year of her life, before she died
OL,9,Ffrom an angiosarcoma, a rare form of
OL,10,Fsoft tissue sarcoma, a type of cancer
OL,11,Fwhich starts in areas of the body such
OL,12,Fas muscle and fat.
